direction: right
Traveler: Traveler {shape: person}
BookingAPI: Booking API {shape: rectangle}
Coordinator: Trip saga coordinator {shape: hexagon}
Flight: Flight service {shape: rectangle}
Hotel: Hotel service {shape: rectangle}
Car: Car rental service {shape: rectangle}
Payment: Payment service {shape: rectangle}
Trips: Trip database {shape: cylinder}
Timeouts: Timeout queue {shape: queue}
Traveler -> BookingAPI: book itinerary
BookingAPI -> Coordinator: start saga
Coordinator -> Flight: hold seat
Flight -> Coordinator: flight held
Coordinator -> Hotel: hold room
Hotel -> Coordinator: room held
Coordinator -> Car: hold vehicle
Car -> Coordinator: vehicle held
Coordinator -> Payment: capture total
Payment -> Coordinator: paid
Coordinator -> Trips: confirm itinerary
Coordinator -> Timeouts: schedule expiry
Hotel -> Coordinator: room unavailable
Coordinator -> Flight: cancel seat
Car -> Coordinator: vehicle unavailable
Coordinator -> Hotel: cancel room
Payment -> Coordinator: payment failed
Coordinator -> Car: cancel vehicle
